msgid ""
"Pedal Calibration\n"
"\n"
"This calibrates the comma pedal interceptor for Pre-AP Tesla Model S.\n"
"\n"
"PRECONDITIONS:\n"
"  1. Device must be offroad\n"
"  2. Car must be ON, Neutral, brake held\n"
"  3. Do NOT press the accelerator\n"
"\n"
"Press START to confirm and begin."
msgstr ""
"Pedal Calibration\n"
"\n"
"This calibrates the comma pedal interceptor for Pre-AP Tesla Model S.\n"
"\n"
"PRECONDITIONS:\n"
